Purpose:
This is the master sitemap that links to all sub-sitemaps for AccellaX 361°.
It helps search engines discover and efficiently crawl all public content
by organizing URLs into logical groups.

Documentation:
- Google: https://developers.google.com/search/docs/advanced/sitemaps/large-sitemaps
- Standard: https://www.sitemaps.org/protocol.html#index

Benefits of Using Sitemap Index:
✓ Organizes large sites with 50,000+ URLs
✓ Separates content by type (pages, blog, images, videos)
✓ Makes sitemap management easier
✓ Allows independent update schedules for different content types
✓ Improves crawl efficiency for search engines
✓ Better analytics (track indexing by content type)

Usage:
Submit this sitemap-index.xml to:
- Google Search Console: https://search.google.com/search-console
- Bing Webmaster Tools: https://www.bing.com/webmasters
- robots.txt: Sitemap: https://your-domain.com/sitemap-index.xml
==============================================================================
-->

